    "created_at": "2022-02-03T23:18:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-03T23:18:54Z",
    "body": "> This works on all the non-HTML whatwg specs, since they're all Bikeshedded, but Wattsi doesn't have the same functionality.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately it does not; it only works on specs that have used those `<div algorithm>` wrappers you mention. Compare:\r\n\r\n- https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-header-list-get-structured-header\r\n- https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#readablestream-set-up\r\n\r\nI'd be hesitant to port this feature over without such scoping... I don't think we have any experience with whether that'd be fine, as you claim, or annoying and confusing, as I might expect.",
