    "body": "Heh, see https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/blob/c504886555dee3381c5b56eb55c297196431a0d6/bikeshed/unsortedJunk.py#L355-L357:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n            // Not highlighting document-global vars,\r\n            // too likely to be unrelated.\r\n            if(algoContainer == null) return;\r\n```",
